{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"rampart_earth_cracked","model_identifier":"rampart_earth_cracked","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# rampart_earth_cracked\n\nDamaged state below 70 % HP of `rampart_earth` (Patch 5): earth torn away in bites from the front and top edge, the sod torn, one stake hanging loose, clods lying at the foot, and dark cracks. Swapped in below 70 % HP and back above 70 % when repaired.\n\n- Footprint: 2 x 2 columns (32 x 32 units, 0.90 x 0.90 m; the notes ask for 1 m, rounded to whole columns), centred on the origin, front (enemy side) faces -Z. Height 71 u (2 m) to the sod.\n- Texture: 256 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 53, all in `finished`; no hidden state sets.\n- The ends (+X and -X) are flat and full height so chunks placed side by side join into one continuous rampart.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 32 x 71 x 32 centred at the origin (the damaged states keep the same hit box: the damage is visual)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_wall_walk` at (0, 71, 2): where a defender stands on top."},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"earth_layer_1_a#6f4f32","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-16,0,-16],"to":[2,12,16],"autouv":0,"color":6,"origin":[-16,0,-16],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[232,60,250,72],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,60,32,72],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,72,18,84],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[32,60,64,72],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,18,32],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[18,0,36,32],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"5da0d5cb-98ab-4531-828f-dbb2f7c5b20b"},{"name":"earth_layer_1_b#7a5737","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling